{"id":"funded-centres-complaints","title":"Publicly funded child-care centres: complaints upheld and serious citations","question":"Which child-care centres on the City's funded list or run by a State contract holder have serious citations or upheld complaints, and are they cited more than centres without public money?","finding":"Of 400 open San Francisco centres in the State file of 15 November 2026, 220 are on the City's funded-centre list or run by an operator with a State child-care or preschool contract for 2025-26. 32 of them carry at least one Type A citation (the State's more serious class) and 9 carry two or more; 32 had a complaint allegation upheld since July 2023. Funded centres average 0.19 Type A citations and 0.23 upheld allegations each, against 0.23 and 0.26 for open centres with no public stream found. The most cited is Nihonmachi Little Friends Sutter Site (Nihonmachi Little Friends): 3 Type A citations, 2 upheld allegations since July 2023. None is on probation.","how":"Every centre licence in San Francisco County was read from the State file. A centre counts as funded when its licence number is on the City's funded-centre list (dated 2025-06-11) or its licensee name matches an agency in the State's 2025-26 child-care (CCTR) or preschool (CSPP) contract tables. Type A and Type B counts add the file's inspection, other-visit and complaint columns. Complaint allegations are dated from the file's complaint records (date, upheld, inconclusive, unsubstantiated, Type A, Type B per complaint); 'upheld' is the file's 'substantiated'.","limits":"A citation is a finding by the licensing office that the centre broke a rule on that day; the file does not say which rule in words, and many Type A citations are corrected on the spot (the file gives a plan-of-correction date). Larger centres get more visits and more complaints, so raw counts favour small centres. The file covers only the visits it lists (about the last five years). Funding is matched by licence number to a City list and by name to State tables: a centre may be funded through the referral agencies without being on either. No record on disk shows dollars paid to a centre in the month of a citation.","tier":"REDFLAG","columns":[{"k":"centre","t":"Centre","type":"text"},{"k":"operator","t":"Operator","type":"org"},{"k":"status","t":"Licence","type":"text"},{"k":"places","t":"Licensed places","type":"int"},{"k":"stream","t":"Public money","type":"text"},{"k":"typeA","t":"Type A citations","type":"int"},{"k":"typeB","t":"Type B citations","type":"int"},{"k":"complaints","t":"Complaints since July 2023","type":"int"},{"k":"upheld","t":"Allegations upheld since July 2023","type":"int"},{"k":"typeAFromComplaints","t":"Type A from those complaints","type":"int"},{"k":"lastUpheld","t":"Latest upheld complaint","type":"date"},{"k":"lastVisit","t":"Last visit","type":"date"}],"rows":[{"centre":"Nihonmachi Little Friends Sutter Site","operator":"Nihonmachi Little Friends","operatorKey":null,"status":"Licensed","places":91,"stream":"City's funded-centre list and State contract to the operator, 2025-26","typeA":3,"typeB":2,"complaints":1,"upheld":2,"typeAFromComplaints":1,"lastUpheld":"2024-07-10","lastVisit":"2025-12-16"},{"centre":"Associated Students Children's Center - Preschool","operator":"Associated Students, Inc. Of S.F. State University","operatorKey":null,"status":"Licensed","places":60,"stream":"City's funded-centre list and State contract to the operator, 2025-26","typeA":2,"typeB":4,"complaints":3,"upheld":3,"typeAFromComplaints":1,"lastUpheld":"2025-04-29","lastVisit":"2026-08-26"},{"centre":"SFUSD-San Miguel Early Education School (PS)","operator":"SFUSD-Early Education Department","operatorKey":null,"status":"Licensed","places":102,"stream":"City's funded-centre list and State contract to the operator, 2025-26","typeA":2,"typeB":3,"complaints":3,"upheld":2,"typeAFromComplaints":2,"lastUpheld":"2026-06-16","lastVisit":"2026-06-08"},{"centre":"Pacific Prima